+
+**Independent Test**: Seed a store with bookmarks carrying different, mixed-case tags, then run
+`list --tag python`, `list --tag PYTHON`, `list --tag py` and `search PYTHON` and check which lines
+come back. Depends on bookmarks existing (US1) but nothing depends on it.
+
