+- [ ] T023 [US2] Add the tag filter to `list_bookmarks(connection, tag=None)` in `src/bookmarks/store.py` as plain SQL `=` equality against the filter value passed through `normalise_tags` from T014 — whole-tag matching then comes free from `=` (FR-012, research R-005)
